# The tauri CLI rewrites Cargo.toml on every build, re-serializing it with LF
# line endings. On a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true the worktree
# file is CRLF, so the rewrite counts as a modification and trips the release
# gate's clean-tree check. Pin TOML to LF everywhere so the rewrite is a no-op.
*.toml text eol=lf
